{
    "title": "Super Jungle Bros: Tribe Boy",
    "description": "Super fun and challenging Jump and Run Jungle Adventures! Fall into the world of a mysterious jungle and get a fascinating experience with Jungle Bros.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf33 Super Jungle Bros: Tribe Boy contains well-designed levels, various enemies, super bosses, simple gameplay, excellent graphics, and soothing music and sounds.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf33 It was a beautiful day in the Lopes Tribe. Tribe Boy was looking for food to prepare for the tribal festival, then suddenly the sky darkens and lightning fills the sky. A mysterious monster appears and kidnaps all the villagers except Tribe Boy, who is absent at that moment \ud83d\ude31 Tribe Boy, our brave adventurer, decides to get on the journey to defeat the enemies and save the homeland.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf33 You can be a super Bob, Lep leprechaun, or whatever you want but becoming a Tribe boy is a different story. Experiencing adventure in this jungle game is more exciting than ever!\r\n\r\nNow your task is to help him run through the mysterious jungle, and jump over the obstacles and super evil monsters to save his friends and family \ud83d\udcaa.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\uddd0 HOW TO PLAY\r\n+ Use buttons to jump, move, and fire\r\n+ Eat hearts and items to become stronger and defeat all monsters\r\n+ Collect all coins and bonus items to get more points and buy additional items in store\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude0d FEATURES\r\n+ Beautiful high-resolution graphics with smooth adventure stories\r\n+ Smooth user interface\r\n+ Music and sound effects\r\n+ Game is no-paid; no purchase required\r\n+ Phone and Tablet support\r\n+ Awesome gameplay similar to the classic retro Game\r\n+ Easy and intuitive controls with the on-screen retro controller\r\n+ Hidden bonus bricks and blocks with heart, axe, and shield\r\n+ Destroyable bricks, blocks, and moving platform\r\n+ Hidden bonus levels with lots of classic and modern coins\r\n+ Additional collectibles, coins, shields, and more\r\n+ Underground and water worlds, swim, jump and run\r\n+ Store with additional items and rewards: unlock worlds before finishing other worlds\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf33 Super Jungle Bros: Tribe Boy is suitable for both kids and adults. The Boy's Adventure has a lot of obstacles but there are a lot of funny moments at the same time. It also reminds you of your childhood, when you were playing games with a 4-button controller. You will help Super Boy run through the jungle adventures, make friends with the dinosaur who can breathe fire, and find what awaits you at the end of the journey.\r\n\r\nPlay Super Jungle Bros: Tribe Boy right now to conquer exciting challenges. Have fun and get through quickly each challenging level in Jungle Adventures.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Super fun and challenging Jump and Run Jungle Adventures! Fall into the world of a mysterious jungle and get a fascinating experience with Jungle Bros.<br><br>\ud83c\udf33 Super Jungle Bros: Tribe Boy contains well-designed levels, various enemies, super bosses, simple gameplay, excellent graphics, and soothing music and sounds.<br><br>\ud83c\udf33 It was a beautiful day in the Lopes Tribe. Tribe Boy was looking for food to prepare for the tribal festival, then suddenly the sky darkens and lightning fills the sky. A mysterious monster appears and kidnaps all the villagers except Tribe Boy, who is absent at that moment \ud83d\ude31 Tribe Boy, our brave adventurer, decides to get on the journey to defeat the enemies and save the homeland.<br><br>\ud83c\udf33 You can be a super Bob, Lep leprechaun, or whatever you want but becoming a Tribe boy is a different story. Experiencing adventure in this jungle game is more exciting than ever!<br><br>Now your task is to help him run through the mysterious jungle, and jump over the obstacles and super evil monsters to save his friends and family \ud83d\udcaa.<br><br>\ud83e\uddd0 HOW TO PLAY<br>+ Use buttons to jump, move, and fire<br>+ Eat hearts and items to become stronger and defeat all monsters<br>+ Collect all coins and bonus items to get more points and buy additional items in store<br><br>\ud83d\ude0d FEATURES<br>+ Beautiful high-resolution graphics with smooth adventure stories<br>+ Smooth user interface<br>+ Music and sound effects<br>+ Game is no-paid; no purchase required<br>+ Phone and Tablet support<br>+ Awesome gameplay similar to the classic retro Game<br>+ Easy and intuitive controls with the on-screen retro controller<br>+ Hidden bonus bricks and blocks with heart, axe, and shield<br>+ Destroyable bricks, blocks, and moving platform<br>+ Hidden bonus levels with lots of classic and modern coins<br>+ Additional collectibles, coins, shields, and more<br>+ Underground and water worlds, swim, jump and run<br>+ Store with additional items and rewards: unlock worlds before finishing other worlds<br><br>\ud83c\udf33 Super Jungle Bros: Tribe Boy is suitable for both kids and adults. The Boy&#39;s Adventure has a lot of obstacles but there are a lot of funny moments at the same time. It also reminds you of your childhood, when you were playing games with a 4-button controller. You will help Super Boy run through the jungle adventures, make friends with the dinosaur who can breathe fire, and find what awaits you at the end of the journey.<br><br>Play Super Jungle Bros: Tribe Boy right now to conquer exciting challenges. Have fun and get through quickly each challenging level in Jungle Adventures.",
